ca-bundle.crt is Mozilla's list of CA root certificates, as curl.se/ca/cacert.pem publishes it (Mozilla data as of
2026-10-20 per the file's header; MPL-2.0). At boot /etc/ssl/cert.pem and /etc/ssl/certs/ca-certificates.crt link here,
which is where OpenSSL (python3's ssl module) looks by default. To trust another CA, set SSL_CERT_FILE or pass cafile.
